# [MLCODEC](../wg/mlcodec.html)

## Summary

The MLCODEC Working Group met to discuss progress on its core extension drafts for the Opus codec. Key topics included resolving a potential memory expansion vulnerability in the Opus extension mechanism draft (`draft-ietf-mlcodec-opus-extension`), reviewing deployment experience for DRED (`draft-ietf-mlcodec-opus-dred`), addressing transport MTU considerations for Opus HD (`draft-ietf-mlcodec-opus-scalable-quality-extension`), and reviewing recent threshold and testing updates to the speech coding enhancement draft (`draft-ietf-mlcodec-opus-speech-coding-enhancement`).

